INSERT INTO `blog_details` VALUES (1,1,1,'EV Charging Management Software: Running Your Network from One Backend','ev-charging-management-software','<p>Learn how CSMS (Charge Station Management System) software helps operators monitor stations, manage users, pricing and payments from a single unified backend. NLP Group\'s CSMS supports OCPP 1.6-J and 2.0.1 protocols, enabling real-time monitoring of all charging sessions, remote diagnostics, dynamic pricing, and seamless payment integration with VietQR, MoMo, and international cards.</p><p>Key features include: multi-station management dashboard, automated billing, energy consumption analytics, user authentication via RFID or mobile app, and 24/7 NOC monitoring support.</p>','2024-10-24 06:13:51','2026-10-08 16:25:36'),(2,2,1,'Are All EV Chargers the Same? The Answer Is No','are-all-ev-chargers-the-same','<p>Not all EV chargers are created equal. This guide compares AC vs DC charging, connector standards (CCS2, CHAdeMO, NACS, GBT), power levels from 7kW to 480kW, and commercial features important for business deployments.</p><p>NLP Group deploys Grasen VP10/02 DC fast chargers at CD Restop highway rest stops across 34 provinces, supporting CCS2 and GB/T standards with smart load balancing and remote management via OCPP 2.0.1.</p>','2024-10-24 06:14:27','2026-10-08 16:25:36'),(3,3,1,'Business EV Charger Guide: Choosing the Right Solution','business-ev-charger-guide','<p>How to choose the right EV charger for offices, hotels, vehicle fleets, and commercial locations. Key considerations include power capacity, connector types, network management, billing options, and installation requirements.</p><p>NLP Group offers end-to-end EV charging solutions for businesses — from hardware (Grasen R-Series, T480Q) to CSMS software, installation support, and 24/7 NOC monitoring across Vietnam.</p>','2024-10-24 06:14:47','2026-10-08 16:25:36'),(4,4,1,'6 Ways to Generate Revenue from Commercial EV Charging Stations','ev-charging-monetization','<p>Commercial EV charging can be a profitable business. Here are 6 proven revenue models: per-kWh charging fees, dynamic pricing, advertising screens at stations, membership packages, parking integration, and fleet service contracts.</p><p>NLP Group\'s CD Restop stations implement multiple revenue streams simultaneously, optimizing profitability while delivering the best experience for EV drivers on Vietnam\'s highway network.</p>','2024-10-24 06:15:06','2026-10-08 16:25:36'),(5,5,1,'Top 10 DC Fast Charger Manufacturers in China (2026)','top-10-dc-fast-charger-manufacturers','<p>A comparison of the top 10 DC fast charger manufacturers in China — their strengths, product lines, and best-fit applications. NLP Group partners with Grasen Technology, ranked among the top manufacturers for reliability, OCPP compliance, and after-sales support in Southeast Asia.</p><p>Key manufacturers covered: Grasen, Star Charge, TELD, BENY, Webasto, Kempower, Tritium, ABB, Siemens, and Schneider Electric.</p>','2024-10-24 06:15:23','2026-10-08 16:25:36'),(6,6,1,'How to Use the EV Charging App: Find Stations, Pay, Track','how-to-use-ev-charging-app','<p>Find the nearest charging station, check pricing, start a charging session, and pay — all in one app. NLP Group\'s CD GO mobile app (Flutter/React Native) allows EV drivers to locate Grasen charging points on the CD Restop network, activate sessions via QR code, monitor State of Charge (SoC) in real time, and pay via VietQR, MoMo, or international cards.</p>','2024-10-30 06:30:12','2026-10-08 16:25:36'),(7,6,2,'Do You Prefer Real Estate Investing? sdfsd','do-you-prefer-real-estate-investig','Share data on the carbon footprint of travel, eco-friendly destinations, and sustainable travel practices. Lorem ipsum dolor, sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Ratione, eligendi sapiente eveniet sequi consectetur quidem corporis quaerat repellendus aliquam fuga minus modi dolorum dolore, natus nihil molestias eius ad est. Share data o