,'2024-10-28 09:23:44','2024-10-28 09:23:44'),(74,40,1,'{\"heading\":\"Welcome to NLP Group\",\"short_title\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"description\":\"<h3>1. Information We Collect<\\/h3><p>We collect personal information including name, email, phone number, address, and identity documents for KYC verification purposes.<\\/p><h3>2. How We Use Your Information<\\/h3><p>Your information is used to process investments, verify identity, comply with Vietnamese financial regulations, and communicate with you about your account.<\\/p><h3>3. Data Security<\\/h3><p>We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your personal data. All financial transactions are processed through licensed banking partners including Military Commercial Joint Stock Bank (MBBank).<\\/p><h3>4. Disclosure<\\/h3><p>We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties except as required by Vietnamese law or with your explicit consent.<\\/p><h3>5. Your Rights<\\/h3><p>You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your personal data. Contact us at phuc.luungoc@mbbank.com.vn.<\\/p>\"}','2024-10-29 03:12:56','2024-10-29 03:12:56'),(75,41,1,'{\"heading\":\"Welcome to NLP Group\",\"short_title\":\"Terms & Conditions\",\"description\":\"<h3>1. Acceptance of Terms<\\/h3><p>By using NLP Group\'s investment platform, you agree to these Terms and Conditions in full. If you disagree, please discontinue use of our services.<\\/p><h3>2. Investment Risk<\\/h3><p>All investments carry risk. Past performance is not indicative of future returns. NLP Group provides investment opportunities based on real assets but cannot guarantee specific returns.<\\/p><h3>3. KYC & AML Compliance<\\/h3><p>All users must complete Know Your Customer (KYC) verification before investing. NLP Group complies fully with Vietnamese Anti-Money Laundering (AML) regulations.<\\/p><h3>4. Fees & Charges<\\/h3><p>Investment management fees, withdrawal charges, and late installment penalties apply as specifi